WEBVTT

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:07.890
Hashiba-kun,

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:10.180
your face is an open book.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:11.300
And I'm done.

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.490
You're such an idiot!

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:17.530
I told you I didn't want to play Old Maid!

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.870
Kobayakawa-san, don't tell him. Now he knows.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:23.000
I'm sorry.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.120
I just felt kind of bad for him.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:27.710
Natsuking's the object of pity!

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:28.500
Natsuki's really such an idiot!

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.020
No, he's just very easy to read.

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:31.580
So are you, Mattsun.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:32.640
What was that?!

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:33.760
Well, you are!

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:34.840
This isn't about me!

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.800
We're talking about Natsuki!

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:39.670
Mari-chan, come and join us.

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:41.680
I'm no good at cards.

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:44.140
Then you'll be fine, Marippe!

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:46.980
We're playing a truth game next!

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.620
I don't wanna.

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:50.680
Why not?

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:53.770
I played this at school once.

00:00:53.770 --> 00:00:57.880
The die had a blank side, so someone
wrote a weird topic there.

00:00:57.880 --> 00:00:59.730
Ah! Sounds like fun.

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:00.450
Huh?!

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:04.620
That means I'll get to know more
about you, Hashiba-kun.

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:06.610
I-If the die plays nice...

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:08.040
I look forward to it.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:09.440
I'm scared...

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.920
Anna, I'm a little hungry,
so I'm going to go buy something.

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:17.380
Okay, I'll come with you.

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:20.300
No thanks, I'm fine on my own.

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:22.310
I'll be right back, so have fun.

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:24.040
Okay.

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:28.450
Huh? Where's Tsutsui-san going?

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:29.770
To the store.

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:32.030
Aw, I wanna go!

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:34.690
I'm hungry, too. I'll go buy us stuff.

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:36.580
I want something sweet.

00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:37.440
Cheese fish-loaf.

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:38.310
Ice cream!

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:40.030
Sure thing.

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:18.080
I sense something behind me.

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:20.100
Great, you're learning!

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:22.430
Why the hell are you here?

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:24.520
I thought I'd hit the store with you.

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:27.940
To make up for that accident,
I'll pay for yours, as well.

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:29.770
Then we'll go join the game.

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:31.190
I'll pass.

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:32.770
It's no fun for me in that room.

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.450
I don't want to be there.

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:37.540
Well, yeah, you didn't play cards at all.

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:39.110
Just watching is boring.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.910
So roll the die and tell us a stor—

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:44.700
I told you, that's no fun for me!

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:49.980
I don't like to see Anna
having fun like that.

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:51.960
I couldn't stand it anymore.

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:55.130
So, just leave me alone.

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:00.840
If you insist on going to the store,
then I'm tagging along.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.390
Look, the elevator's here.

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:07.850
I'm telling you to leave me alone!

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:08.940
Hey!

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:10.980
Follow me, and I'll beat you to death!

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:14.690
Talk about a grudge.

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:17.110
When Tsuyopon gave me a can of soda!

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:19.090
It sprayed everywhere when I opened it!

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:22.850
It went in my eyes and up my nose,
and it hurt all day, and I hate him!

00:04:22.850 --> 00:04:23.490
Sorry...

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:24.880
You did it on purpose!

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:28.200
I didn't expect it to go off with such force...

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.410
Oh, I have a call.

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:31.040
Hello, it's me.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.830
Yeah? What is it?

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:35.250
The shop's already closed.

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:38.190
Is the first-floor shop the only one?
Any in the basement?

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:40.680
Uh, I think it's just the first floor.

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:43.180
Then, has Spitting Woman gotten back yet?

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:44.360
She's not here.

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:45.870
She's not here, either.

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:47.100
Seriously?

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:51.520
Um, maybe she went back to the other room.

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:56.360
She's not here.

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:02.910
It's Mari-chan's.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:04.400
No luck.

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.610
She left her phone behind.

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:08.370
She can't have gotten lost, right?

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:12.040
I'm worried about her.
I'll go take a look around.

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:14.950
We'll wait here in the room, then.

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:16.010
Na-chan.

00:05:16.010 --> 00:05:16.420
Huh?

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:19.460
Aren't you worried about
Kobayakawa-san going by herself?

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:20.970
Ah! Right.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.380
No...

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:26.670
No customers have asked us
to verify their room number today.

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:28.410
I see.

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:30.460
Please let us know if she does.

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:31.850
Certainly.

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:34.190
Now where'd she go?

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:37.680
Honestly, she's such a pain to deal with.

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:39.980
Leave me alone.

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:42.690
She really is.

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:45.320
<i>What now?</i>

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:47.580
<i>The shop was closed.</i>

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:48.720
<i>And...</i>

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:50.580
<i>I forgot our room number!</i>

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:54.570
<i>It's embarrassing, but I'll just
have to ask at the front desk.</i>

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:57.480
<i>Let's see, it was under
her name, which is...</i>

00:05:57.480 --> 00:05:58.430
Yukirin.

00:05:58.430 --> 00:05:59.190
Yukirin-san.

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:01.240
Yukirin.

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:02.910
<i>I forgot her full name!</i>

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:04.510
<i>And my phone's in my room!</i>

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:09.560
<i>I have the worst luck...</i>

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:11.910
<i>Maybe someone will come find me.</i>

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:15.370
<i>Maybe Anna will get worried
and come looking...</i>

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.940
<i>Or she's caught up in the game</i>

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:20.680
<i>and isn't even thinking about me.</i>

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:22.410
<i>She's been having fun the whole time...</i>

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:24.870
<i>Up until recently,</i>

00:06:24.870 --> 00:06:25.700
<i>whether at school,</i>

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:27.590
<i>or on the way home,</i>

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:29.700
<i>or on our days off,
we've always been together.</i>

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:33.520
<i>Hey, does it bother you
to be with me all the time?</i>

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:34.120
<i>I'm fine.</i>

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:36.950
<i>I enjoy being with you.</i>

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:41.040
<i>I thought she was only like that with me.</i>

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.890
<i>But now, Anna's...</i>

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:45.340
I-It'll be fine!

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:46.620
I'm just imagining things!

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:48.700
Anna is sure to come looking for me!

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:50.930
If I just wait here...!

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:54.350
<i>There! It's Anna!</i>

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:56.690
<i>Crap! He's here, too!</i>

00:06:56.690 --> 00:06:58.880
<i>I only want Anna! You get lost!</i>

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:01.900
There's no sign of her anywhere.

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.280
Where could she have gone?

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:07.200
Um, do you think Tsutsui-san's
been pushing herself too hard?

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:08.490
Huh?!

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:10.930
She was feeling ill at the amusement park.

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:14.910
Maybe she's not used to traveling,
and didn't really want to come along?

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:17.860
And I get the feeling she dislikes me.

00:07:17.860 --> 00:07:21.840
And that's why she doesn't want
to come back to the room.

00:07:22.260 --> 00:07:26.600
If that's the case, I feel bad
for pushing her to come.

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:29.560
Hashiba-kun,

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:31.050
do you dislike Mari-chan?

00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:33.570
No! I don't dislike her!

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:36.100
She's your precious friend!

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:36.980
It's just...

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:40.400
...I wish she'd open up to us a bit more.

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:41.610
It'll be fine.

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:42.450
You sure?

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:43.820
Both Mari-chan and I

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:48.240
are happy that we've become closer
with you and your friends.

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:50.200
So, it'll be fine.

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:51.330
Thank goodness.

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:53.240
Okay, let's look over there one more time.

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:54.120
Sure.

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:55.960
<i>What the hell?</i>

00:07:56.810 --> 00:08:00.190
<i>Anna doesn't understand me at all!</i>

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:01.880
<i>She really has changed.</i>

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:04.800
<i>If only she'd never met them.</i>

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:08.340
<i>Then I could've been alone with Anna forever.</i>

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:11.720
<i>Curse that guy!</i>

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:13.590
<i>Maybe I'll get in their way again.</i>

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:15.550
<i>I'll scratch the little
monkey's face, drag Anna off.</i>

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:18.160
<i>Then tell her about all kinds of
awful things he did, true or not!</i>

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:19.640
<i>Enough that she'll despise him.</i>

00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:21.310
<i>Yeah, that's it!</i>

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:23.520
<i>I haven't been myself lately!</i>

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.570
<i>Why am I just following at their pace?</i>

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:27.780
<i>Enough of that.</i>

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:30.280
<i>Anna's the only one I care about.</i>

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:33.320
<i>If we haven't found her after all this time...</i>

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:35.230
<i>...maybe she's in trouble?</i>

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:37.750
<i>She was acting pretty weird.</i>

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.920
You...! Spitting Woman?

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:43.790
What're you doing here?

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:47.260
Are you feeling sick?

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:53.010
What's wrong?

00:08:53.770 --> 00:08:54.910
I'm just so angry.

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:58.550
The two of us were always happy together.

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:01.770
But once you people came along,
my beloved Anna changed!

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:04.700
She doesn't understand how I feel.

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:07.150
And she's interested in
all this other stuff now.

00:09:07.530 --> 00:09:11.620
So, I was thinking I'd do something
horrible to get between them.

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:14.530
But somehow, I just can't do it.

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:16.600
What'll I do now?

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:19.980
Maybe I don't love Anna anymore.

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:24.350
Why are you laughing, jerk?!

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:25.770
Oh, sorry.

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:26.890
I was amused.

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:27.540
Huh?!

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:29.060
Listen, I'm being serious here!

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:30.880
Well, can you blame me?

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:32.920
You're a man-hater.

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:35.170
Foul-mouthed, and a pain to deal with.

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:37.200
You scratch up my face over nothing.

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:39.810
And, worst of all, you spit at me.

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:44.440
But you have moments of weakness
where you fret and cry like this.

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:47.150
It's just so amusing,
I don't know what to do.

00:09:47.530 --> 00:09:49.030
I can't help loving you.

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:50.120
Huh?

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:51.400
And, besides,

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:54.610
isn't it unfair for you to be
telling me all this while crying?

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:56.320
You'll get my hopes up.

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.530
It's a real problem.

00:09:58.530 --> 00:09:59.850
Hold on.

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:02.760
Did you just make this all about you?

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:04.740
Yeah, now that you mention it.

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:07.000
I don't care about you,
it's me and Anna that—

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.660
Yeah, I know.

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:10.860
I just wanted to tell you that.

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:12.880
Seriously, quit joking around like that!

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:16.800
Well, the problem is,
I'm actually serious.

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:18.610
You're just getting creepier!

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:19.820
Fine, come on.

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:22.230
Let's get you back to Kobayakawa-san.

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:23.730
Everyone's worried about you.

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:25.630
No.

00:10:25.630 --> 00:10:28.650
I'll have trouble deciding
what I should do again.

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:30.570
What, is that all?

00:10:31.140 --> 00:10:33.320
Just be more honest with yourself.

00:10:33.620 --> 00:10:35.510
Haven't you figured it out?

00:10:35.510 --> 00:10:38.810
It's not that you've stopped
loving Kobayakawa-san,

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:41.610
it's that you can't hate us anymore.

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:45.990
<i>Maybe what Anna was saying was right.</i>

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:50.190
<i>Maybe I've changed too.</i>

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:53.270
<i>Ah, so even this can be fun.</i>

00:10:53.270 --> 00:10:55.490
<i>That's what I was actually thinking.</i>

00:10:55.490 --> 00:10:57.740
<i>I felt the same way as Anna.</i>

00:10:57.740 --> 00:10:58.260
<i>But...</i>

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:00.530
<i>...that frustrated me,</i>

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:02.600
<i>and there were parts I just couldn't accept.</i>

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:05.450
Well, come back once you've settled down.

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:07.560
We're in Room 2015.

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:10.820
But, now...

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:11.980
W-Wait!

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:14.000
I'll head back, too.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:15.410
I want to roll that die.

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:21.410
<i>I thought I could stand to be
a bit more honest about myself.</i>

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:27.890
<i>Hot damn! This girl's really something!</i>

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:30.420
<i>Still, this guy's as creepy as ever.</i>
